name: forge-router
description: >-
  Route unfamiliar or multi-domain work through Forge's installed catalog when visible skills are
  tiered, truncated, or ambiguous. Use for bounded candidate discovery, exclusions, risk-aware
  composition, and on-demand loading. Do not use when one sufficient skill is already selected or
